只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Every skill you already have — Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI — works in DSH: Agent Skills SKILL.md discovery, Tier-2 conversions, find_skill search, and a skills doctor","id":"gh:1333350638","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-skillport","slug":"Jesse-njx/dsh-skillport","topics":["agent-skills","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","skillport","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Every skill you already have — Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI — works in DSH: Agent Skills S"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"KILL.md discovery, Tier-2 conversions, find_skill search, and a skills doctor"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-skillport"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Every skill you already have — Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI — works in DSH.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-skillport` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin bundle that makes DSH the next implementer of the open "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"**Agent Skills** standard (`SKILL.md`). Anthropic released the spec in Dec 2025 and 30+ harnesses re"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ad it (Codex CLI, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Copilot/VS Code, Goose, Windsurf); DSH did not. Skillport impo"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"rts the whole existing ecosystem with **zero migration**: your `.claude/skills/` library, your Curso"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"r rules, your Claude Code slash commands all become DSH skills the moment the plugin loads."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Format | Source | How it lands in DSH |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Agent Skills `SKILL.md` | `.claude/skills/`, `~/.claude/skills/` (Claude Code) | model-invocable s"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"kills |\n| Agent Skills `SKILL.md` | `~/.gemini/antigravity/skills/` (Gemini CLI) | model-invocable s"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"kills |\n| Agent Skills `SKILL.md` | `extraPaths` (config) | model-invocable skills |\n| Agent Skills "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"`SKILL.md` | `.dsh/skills/`, `.agents/skills/` (+ user roots) | scanned natively by DSH — skillport "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"never double-scans |\n| Cursor rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | converted to model-invocable skills (s"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ource `cursor`) |\n| Claude Code commands | `.claude/commands/*.md` | converted to **user-invokable**"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" skills (`/name`) |\n| Context files | `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` | injected as project context **only "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"if** DSH does not already (native `dsh-agent-instructions` wins — no double-injection) |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Skills flow into the native skill registry (`ctx.skills`), so the platform's own catalog injection, "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"progressive-disclosure index, and the `skill` loader tool surface them automatically. **Registration"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"s are Cordis effects: `dsh plugin remove @dsh-skillport/bundle` unloads every imported skill cleanly"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"** — a live demo of the platform's teardown model."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why this shape"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"DSH already ships a full skill stack: a provider registry with rank-based dedup, catalog injection ("},{"id":"p10s2","text":"names + descriptions in the system prompt), and a `skill` tool that loads bodies and resolves bundle"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"d file paths. Skillport's job is narrower and honest: **discover the locations DSH does not cover, c"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"onvert the adjacent formats, and make the result debuggable.** That is exactly the spec's \"check fir"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"st — don't double-inject\" instruction applied to the whole surface:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- `.dsh/skills` + `.agents/skills` are scanned by DSH's native `dsh-skill-filesystem`; skillport det"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ects that provider and skips those sets (falling back to scanning them itself only when the native p"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"rovider is absent, so the full table holds in any composition).\n- The spec's \"injection\" (names + de"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"scriptions) and \"use_skill\" (load body + resolve resources) are the native `dsh-tool-skill` catalog "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"and `skill` tool — skillport feeds them, it does not duplicate them.\n- `AGENTS.md`/`CLAUDE.md` are i"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"njected natively by `dsh-agent-instructions`; skillport takes over only when that plugin is absent."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then in a session: ask the model to load a skill you used to own in Claude Code — the catalog lists "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"it and the `skill` tool loads it, bundled resources included."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"All fields optional (profile patch or `cordis.patch.yml`):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Skills doctor"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Trigger-quality is the fuzzy failure mode: skills tuned for Claude's triggering habits may fire diff"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"erently on DeepSeek models. Skillport turns that into a debuggable surface."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"In-session (`/skills doctor [<description>]`):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Terminal (no DSH session needed):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Pinned spec revision"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The Agent Skills format is young and versioned. Skillport pins the revision it implements — see docs"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"/spec-revision.md — and ships a conformance fixture suite (missing fields, unicode names, nested res"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ources) so spec drift fails loudly in CI."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Non-goals (deliberately)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Claude Code plugins / hooks / subagents** — executable host-specific semantics; porting prose-an"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"d-scripts is honest, pretending to port hook systems is a bug factory.\n- **MCP config translation** "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"— out of scope.\n- **Codex / Cursor extension binaries** — out of scope.\n- Skillport never gets its o"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"wn execution path: skills that carry scripts run through DSH's normal shell tool inside its sandbox,"},{"id":"p27s5","text":" so the sandbox policy stays the single enforcement point."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Fixtures: `test/fixtures/` holds one skill per source format, conformance edge cases, and the checke"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"d-in goldens for the injected index + doctor report."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
